{"title":"1987 AHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following is closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/7/467b21534faabf4f0041910c7a0507e5c9c4519a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{65}-\\sqrt{63}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/c/43c4f1c0a1552ca14d7926a77e257c3964bbd828.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ .12 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ .13 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ .14 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ .15 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ .16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"419\" height=\"17\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/f/a5f2ff3b87d0c9eba585538a18850c94d6bd7378.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{65} &gt; 8 &gt; 7.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"116\" height=\"21\" />. Also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/c/81c64ace2208a23ad7e98b9e4caa854b01c3d247.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7.5^2 = (7 + 0.5)^2 = 7^2 + 2 \\cdot 7 \\cdot 0.5 + 0.5^2 = 49 + 7 + 0.25 = 56.25 &lt; 63$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"550\" height=\"19\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/8/328447ffcc175c1637cd8089d7e1d70fd63f7664.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{63} &gt; 7.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf404a7eaf1995ac3e97faaeca9ce68c2cbb2eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{65} + \\sqrt{63} &gt; 7.5 + 7.5 = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"223\" height=\"18\" />. Now notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/1/ba1821b3626aaf3d43de9f285c861efe51cbb0c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{65} - \\sqrt{63} = \\frac{(\\sqrt{65} - \\sqrt{63})(\\sqrt{65} + \\sqrt{63})}{\\sqrt{65} + \\sqrt{63}} = \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{65} + \\sqrt{63}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"438\" height=\"45\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/e/f4e1a1d24850c854e8611b029554bd770452156f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{65} - \\sqrt{63} &lt; \\frac{2}{15} = 0.1333333...$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"250\" height=\"37\" />, so the answer must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. If we can show \\sqrt{65} + \\sqrt{63} &lt; 16, then we will have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/0/44066f269029bfd25eb393ddd8b5658763b4cf95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{65} + \\sqrt{63}} &gt; 2/16 = 0.125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"221\" height=\"43\" /> and hence the answer must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p><br />\nThe proof of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/0/260b269e8be67308d3f8f667f5edc53cd06a238e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{65} + \\sqrt{63} &lt; 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"133\" height=\"21\" /> is as follows:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/0/250a6391f8f8bda400009b4e4df2d7b3d91e5854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{65} + \\sqrt{63} &lt; 16 \\iff 65 + 2\\sqrt{65 \\cdot 63} + 63 &lt; 256 \\iff 128 + 2\\sqrt{4095} &lt; 256 \\iff \\sqrt{4095} &lt; 64 \\iff 4095 &lt; 4096$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"906\" height=\"21\" /> which is true. \n</p><p><br />\n(<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/1/de1555a1e36b8019015062c9b78167f1b8416668.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{65} - \\sqrt{63}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" /> is approximately equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/d/30db9ae47a60b9996be2820d182cf00db873e052.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.125003815$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"95\" height=\"13\" />)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME\" title=\"1987 AHSME\">1987 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1987 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1987_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1987 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1987\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wi